        ex:hasText "Regarding GDPR compliance (con:con35, con:con36) for personal data protection, our services are designed to comply with GDPR, as indicated by we ISO 27001 and ISO 27701 certifications. we ensure that all processing of personal data is carried out in accordance with Article 28 of GDPR (dpa_alignment)." ;
