        ex:hasText "In light of the legal requirements including strict GDPR compliance (req:req45, req:req49, req:req50), non-disclosure of personal and financial data outside the EU (req:req51), ensuring professional secrecy and auditor independence (req:req100, con:con49), and adhering to legal retention and archival obligations (con:con52), what are the key legal risks that need to be addressed in our proposal, and how can our demonstrate compliance with these regulatory frameworks while also respecting data sovereignty (req:req101) and ensuring the solution does not undermine existing legal obligations?" ;
